	(text "Eye LEDs: anode to +5V0_LOGIC, each cathode through its resistor to a PCA9685 #2 channel.\nRed 220 ohm, green/blue 150 ohm (about 13 mA each). Run PCA9685 #2 in open-drain mode\n(MODE2 OUTDRV = 0) so the 3.3V-powered outputs can sink the 5V LED current." (at 454.660 285.750 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)) (uuid "f75dc1b3-b5e2-4a15-8ccd-c6bbcbbbca1d"))
